<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>My Special Message ❤️</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .box {
      background: white;
      padding: 35px 25px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      width: 80%;
      max-width: 400px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    h1 {
      color: #ff3366;
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    p {
      color: #555;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    button {
      background: #ff3366;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 25px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-size: 17px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    #message {
      display: none;
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: #ff3366;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="box">
    <h1>Hey ❤️</h1>

    <p>
      Tum mere liye bahut special ho... 💕<br>
      Isliye aaj dil ki ek baat kehni hai.
    </p>

    <h2>Will You Be Mine? 💖</h2>

    <button onclick="showLove()">Click Here ❤️</button>

    <div id="message">
      I Love You ❤️🥰<br>
      You are very special to me! 💕
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function showLove() {
      document.getElementById("message").style.display = "block";
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
